&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1zaWRlYmFyLXRpdGxl"&gt;Experimentology 中文版&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1uYXZiYXItdGl0bGU="&gt;Experimentology 中文版&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1uZXh0"&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;E&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;ggplot 绘图&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1wcmV2"&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;Quarto (and R Markdown)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1zaWRlYmFyOi9pbmRleC5odG1s5YmN6KiA"&gt;前言&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1zaWRlYmFyOnF1YXJ0by1zaWRlYmFyLXNlY3Rpb24tMQ=="&gt;基础&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1zaWRlYmFyOi8wMDEtZXhwZXJpbWVudHMuaHRtbDxzcGFuLWNsYXNzPSdjaGFwdGVyLW51bWJlcic+MTwvc3Bhbj4tLTxzcGFuLWNsYXNzPSdjaGFwdGVyLXRpdGxlJz7lrp7pqow8L3NwYW4+"&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;实验&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1zaWRlYmFyOi8wMDItdGhlb3JpZXMuaHRtbDxzcGFuLWNsYXNzPSdjaGFwdGVyLW51bWJlcic+Mjwvc3Bhbj4tLTxzcGFuLWNsYXNzPSdjaGFwdGVyLXRpdGxlJz7nkIborro8L3NwYW4+"&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;理论&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1zaWRlYmFyOi8wMDMtcmVwbGljYXRpb24uaHRtbDxzcGFuLWNsYXNzPSdjaGFwdGVyLW51bWJlcic+Mzwvc3Bhbj4tLTxzcGFuLWNsYXNzPSdjaGFwdGVyLXRpdGxlJz7ph43lpI3pqozor4E8L3NwYW4+"&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;重复验证&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1zaWRlYmFyOi8wMDQtZXRoaWNzLmh0bWw8c3Bhbi1jbGFzcz0nY2hhcHRlci1udW1iZXInPjQ8L3NwYW4+LS08c3Bhbi1jbGFzcz0nY2hhcHRlci10aXRsZSc+5Lym55CGPC9zcGFuPg=="&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;伦理&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1zaWRlYmFyOnF1YXJ0by1zaWRlYmFyLXNlY3Rpb24tMg=="&gt;统计&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1zaWRlYmFyOi8wMDUtZXN0aW1hdGlvbi5odG1sPHNwYW4tY2xhc3M9J2NoYXB0ZXItbnVtYmVyJz41PC9zcGFuPi0tPHNwYW4tY2xhc3M9J2NoYXB0ZXItdGl0bGUnPuS8sOiuoTwvc3Bhbj4="&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;估计&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1zaWRlYmFyOi8wMDYtaW5mZXJlbmNlLmh0bWw8c3Bhbi1jbGFzcz0nY2hhcHRlci1udW1iZXInPjY8L3NwYW4+LS08c3Bhbi1jbGFzcz0nY2hhcHRlci10aXRsZSc+5o6o5patPC9zcGFuPg=="&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;推断&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1zaWRlYmFyOi8wMDctbW9kZWxzLmh0bWw8c3Bhbi1jbGFzcz0nY2hhcHRlci1udW1iZXInPjc8L3NwYW4+LS08c3Bhbi1jbGFzcz0nY2hhcHRlci10aXRsZSc+5qih5Z6LPC9zcGFuPg=="&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;模型&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1zaWRlYmFyOnF1YXJ0by1zaWRlYmFyLXNlY3Rpb24tMw=="&gt;规划&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1zaWRlYmFyOi8wMDgtbWVhc3VyZW1lbnQuaHRtbDxzcGFuLWNsYXNzPSdjaGFwdGVyLW51bWJlcic+ODwvc3