cic+QTwvc3Bhbj4tLTxzcGFuLWNsYXNzPSdjaGFwdGVyLXRpdGxlJz7mlZnluIjmjIfljZc8L3NwYW4+"&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;教师指南&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1zaWRlYmFyOi8xMDEtZ2l0aHViLmh0bWw8c3Bhbi1jbGFzcz0nY2hhcHRlci1udW1iZXInPkI8L3NwYW4+LS08c3Bhbi1jbGFzcz0nY2hhcHRlci10aXRsZSc+R2l0LeWSjC1HaXRIdWI8L3NwYW4+"&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;Git 和 GitHub&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1zaWRlYmFyOi8xMDItcm1hcmtkb3duLmh0bWw8c3Bhbi1jbGFzcz0nY2hhcHRlci1udW1iZXInPkM8L3NwYW4+LS08c3Bhbi1jbGFzcz0nY2hhcHRlci10aXRsZSc+UXVhcnRvLShhbmQtUi1NYXJrZG93bik8L3NwYW4+"&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;Quarto (and R Markdown)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1zaWRlYmFyOi8xMDMtdGlkeXZlcnNlLmh0bWw8c3Bhbi1jbGFzcz0nY2hhcHRlci1udW1iZXInPkQ8L3NwYW4+LS08c3Bhbi1jbGFzcz0nY2hhcHRlci10aXRsZSc+VGlkeXZlcnNlLeW3peWFt+mbhjwvc3Bhbj4="&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;D&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;Tidyverse 工具集&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWludC1zaWRlYmFyOi8xMDQtZ2dwbG90Lmh0bWw8c3Bhbi1jbGFzcz0nY2hhcHRlci1udW1iZXInPkU8L3NwYW4+LS08c3Bhbi1jbGFzcz0nY2hhcHRlci10aXRsZSc+Z2dwbG90Lee7mOWbvjwvc3Bhbj4="&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;E&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;ggplot 绘图&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWJyZWFkY3J1bWJzLemZhOW9lQ=="&gt;附录&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="cXVhcnRvLWJyZWFkY3J1bWJzLTxzcGFuLWNsYXNzPSdjaGFwdGVyLW51bWJlcic+RDwvc3Bhbj4tLTxzcGFuLWNsYXNzPSdjaGFwdGVyLXRpdGxlJz5UaWR5dmVyc2Ut5bel5YW36ZuGPC9zcGFuPg=="&gt;&lt;span class="chapter-number"&gt;D&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class="chapter-title"&gt;Tidyverse 工具集&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hidden quarto-markdown-envelope-contents" data-render-id="c2lkZWJhci1mb290ZXI="&gt;
&lt;div class="sidebar-footer-item"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;本地中文版翻译稿。原作：&lt;em&gt;Experimentology: An Open Science Approach to Experimental Psychology Methods&lt;/em&gt;，Michael C. Frank、Mika Braginsky、Julie Cachia、Nicholas A. Coles、Tom E. Hardwicke、Robert D. Hawkins、Maya B. Mathur 和 Rondeline Williams。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;本翻译稿为非官方中文翻译，仅用于本地阅读和翻译审校。公开发布前，需要再次核对原作许可、署名要求、非商业限制以及书中第三方材料的使用条件。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;原作许可见项目 README 和原书页面。&lt;/p&gt;
